      "Checkpoints, Dirty Page Flushing & Torn-Page Protection (Full Page Writes) (checkpoints-dirty-page-flushing): Bounding crash recovery time with spread checkpoints, and why the first modification to an 8KB page after a checkpoint logs a Full Page Image (FPI).",
